{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"747511806809079919","content":"```\nBootlegger\nSkill Proficiency: Deception, Survival\nTool Proficiency: Vehicle (Land), Brewing\nEquipment: One permanent Counterfeit Curfew Pass for Hampstead (DC10), a set of common clothing, a mason jar of 190 proof alcohol, and a leather pouch containing 5 gold\n\nFeature: Give em the slip\nYou always keep an eye out for an exit if the situation goes south, and know how to create an opportunity to slip away.  When in the streets and needing to give someone the slip, you can make an opposed roll, your survival vs their perception.  If you succeed, you get away with the items on your person.```","created_at":"2021-06-24T00:34:47.653000Z","edited_at":"2021-06-24T01:36:59.762000Z","id":"857418446260928543","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
